{
 "title": "遍历集合",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "方括号里的列表叫做**数组**：`[2, 3, 5]`。它的类型写作 `[N]类型`（`N` 是元素个数）。用 `for` 逐个取出元素。如果还需要位置，就写两个变量：`for 索引, 元素 in 数组`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    primes: [4]i32 = [2, 3, 5, 7]",
    "    for p in primes:",
    "        print(\"Prime:\", p)",
    "    names: [3]str = [\"Ali\", \"Ayşe\", \"Zeynep\"]",
    "    for idx, name in names:",
    "        print(idx, name)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Prime: 2",
    "Prime: 3",
    "Prime: 5",
    "Prime: 7",
    "0 Ali",
    "1 Ayşe",
    "2 Zeynep"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "如果循环体修改了元素，修改会直接写回数组："
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    numbers: [3]i32 = [10, 20, 30]",
    "    for s in numbers:",
    "        s *= 2",
    "    for s in numbers:",
    "        print(s)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "20",
    "40",
    "60"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c02-l05-x1",
   "prompt": "求数组中各数之和并输出。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    numbers: [4]i32 = [3, 4, 5, 6]",
    "    total = 0",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    numbers: [4]i32 = [3, 4, 5, 6]",
    "    total = 0",
    "    for s in numbers:",
    "        total += s",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "hint": "在 `for s in numbers:` 里执行 `total += s`。",
   "expected": [
    "18"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c02-l05-q1",
   "q": "在 `for i, x in array:` 中，`i` 保存什么？",
   "options": [
    "元素的值",
    "元素的位置（索引）",
    "数组的长度"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "第一个变量是位置，第二个是元素。"
  }
 ]
}
